    "name": "Temporal Hierarchy of Architectural Prediction Error — Integration Across Timescales",
    "structural_pattern": "Architectural experience integrates PE events across 7 logarithmic timescales, from milliseconds (perceptual) to centuries (cultural). The quality of experience depends on the coherent nesting of these scales. Architecture is a 'multi-scalar temporal composition'. CALIBRATION (TP-II): Variance Decomposition suggests T1 (40%) and T2 (25%) dominate immediate appraisal, but T4+ determines long-term bond.",
